{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:LiftingAndDescent.CcgCrossedModuleStructure","@type":"LeanModule","name":"LiftingAndDescent.CcgCrossedModuleStructure","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.LiftingDescent.CosimplicialCrossedGroupoid"],"declarations":2,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.LiftingDescent.ccg_crossed_module_peiffer","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.LiftingDescent.ccg_crossed_module_peiffer","kind":"theorem","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/ccg-crossed-module-structure.lean#L40-L48","doc":"The per-level crossed module is exactly `ccg.crossedMod n` and\ninherits Peiffer for free from the `CrossedModule` structure. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.LiftingDescent.ccg_crossed_module_structure","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.LiftingDescent.ccg_crossed_module_structure","kind":"theorem","line":27,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/ccg-crossed-module-structure.lean#L27-L38","doc":"**Crossed-module structure at each level of the brane-tower CCG.**\n\nAt every level `n`, the cosimplicial crossed groupoid yields a\n`CrossedModule` whose carriers package the level-`n` analogues\nof `SU_qₙ(2)` and `𝒪_M^×`.  The Peiffer identity is part of the\n`CrossedModule` structure and is therefore automatic. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:lem:ccg-crossed-module-structure","label":"lem:ccg-crossed-module-structure","md":"quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/ccg-crossed-module-structure.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}